# Git: main only

- Stay on `main`. Do not create a feature branch, worktree, or PR unless the user names one.
- When asked to commit, commit on `main`. Do not branch first.
- When asked to push, push `main` to **both** remotes so GitHub matches local:
  - `hekma` = `HekmaAI/hekma-platform` (org repo the team looks at)
  - `origin` = `rajhekma/hekma-platform` (personal fork)
- If only one remote is requested, use `hekma` (org), not `origin` alone.
- Never force-push `main`.
